  <content>
  <section><para>Which of the following is
    true of the following system of equations?</para>
<para>\(\begin{array}{rcl}&amp;&amp;\left\{\begin{array}{l}7x\;+\;6y\;=\;2\\–28x\;–\;24y\;=\;–8\end{array}\right.\end{array}\)</para></section>
</content>
